        1342,
        977
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(b) Except to the extent otherwise provided by law, the employment or continued employment of all existing and prospective Inspectors General and members of their staffs shall be subject to complete background investigations and approval by the Department of Investigation.",
